### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user",
  "pw": "user@pass",
  "name": "일반유저",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 2. 회원 목록
GET http://localhost/member/list

### 3. 회원 상세보기
GET http://localhost/member/get/admin

### 4. 회원 수정
PUT http://localhost/member/update/adming
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "수정된 이름",
  "phone": "010-0987-6543"
}

### 5. 회원 삭제
DELETE http://localhost/member/delete/amongus